0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M4Ph"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0311290-8772-4334-b62e-66e6b337b0ea","type":"message","user":"UEBF2KQTD","text":"ただ、このやり方だと1つ問題があって","ts":"1633150824.034700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ZxZQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94c6b75f-6a53-43cd-b995-aa3a683491be","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど、partial をうまく使っていますね","ts":"1633150817.034500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UEBF2KQTD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g8vV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49fc239d-60ed-410f-8c22-e6fc598d9805","type":"message","user":"UEBF2KQTD","text":"\u003c@U03C71D7H\u003e\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/ryanoasis/vim-devicons/blob/master/test/filetype.vim#L5-L20\u003e\n\n↑のリンクのように行いました！","ts":"1633150765.033900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/ryanoasis/vim-devicons/blob/master/test/filetype.vim | filetype.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/ryanoasis/vim-devicons/blob/master/test/filetype.vim | filetype.vim\u003e","text":"```\nlet s:suite = themis#suite('WebDevIconsGetFileTypeSymbol')\nlet s:assert = themis#helper('assert')\n\nfunction! s:Assert(filename, icon)\n  call s:assert.equals(WebDevIconsGetFileTypeSymbol(a:filename), a:icon)\nendfunction\n\nfunction! s:suite.__OneArgument_VimIcon__()\n  let targetfilenames = ['.vimrc', 'vimrc', '.gvimrc', '_gvimrc', 'test.vim']\n  let expecticon = ''\n  let child = themis#suite('OneArgument_VimIcon')\n\n  for targetfilename in targetfilenames\n    let child[targetfilename] = funcref('s:Assert', [targetfilename, expecticon])\n  endfor\nendfunction\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/ryanoasis/vim-devicons|ryanoasis/vim-devicons\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"arvx0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87C5AA12-0651-41CA-96E9-16386F57332A","type":"message","user":"UEBF2KQTD","text":"ベーシックスタイルでやりました","ts":"1633150631.033500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ai5w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a98cde77-c5e9-4e06-89c3-433129ca1947","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"vimspec style でやりたいなぁ","ts":"1633147103.033100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gGmP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88e76434-e906-4396-b8df-6231d95f41b4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"IK さんもたぶん basic style でやったのかな","ts":"1633147097.032900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UGz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"620ea9da-3989-4f78-8573-255376432ab4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"vimspec style でやる場合は、動的なテスト生成が現状できないのでなにか仕組みを足さないといけない。応用が効く形にしたいところだが…","ts":"1633146817.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Q+Ul"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94a22dc8-20d5-46e3-b266-382ef6ec0f09","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"動的にテストのユニットを作れれば済む。実際のところ themis.vim でも basic style でならそれが可能","ts":"1633146767.031600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"68=Ou"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b37f2bb-7779-4773-9cf8-25454eea932d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあでも Go はさすがは Go だな。並列化の部分以外は特別な仕組みとかなしに愚直にデータを作って愚直に回している感じ","ts":"1633146714.031000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Su/u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d545beae-c7c9-4b41-b9f0-68251f213cb9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Go では Table Drive